{"4048470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chicks In Trouble", "steam_appid": 4048470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f9613833baac801a260f0308882c5392.poster.avif?t=1788207489\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f9613833baac801a260f0308882c5392.webm?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f9613833baac801a260f0308882c5392.mp4?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🐣 Rescue Every Chick. Outsmart the Farm. Save the Flock!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful day on the farm turns into a frantic rescue mission when the chicks mysteriously disappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a brave father rooster and set off on a wholesome puzzle adventure filled with clever obstacles, hidden paths, mischievous farm animals, and adorable baby chicks waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players of all ages, <strong>Chicks In Trouble</strong> combines exploration, light action and relaxing puzzle-solving into a charming family-friendly adventure that's easy to pick up but rewarding to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌾 Explore a Living Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across colorful farm environments packed with secrets, shortcuts, and surprises. Every area introduces new challenges as you search for every missing chick.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Solve Creative Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to overcome environmental puzzles, activate mechanisms, discover hidden routes, and complete a variety of fun mini-games inspired by familiar puzzle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/b7a875876bfddb33bb275a315a4b9063.poster.avif?t=1788207489\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/b7a875876bfddb33bb275a315a4b9063.webm?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/b7a875876bfddb33bb275a315a4b9063.mp4?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐕 Watch Out for Trouble!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm isn't as peaceful as it looks. Sneak past grumpy dogs, curious sheeps, suspicious farmers, and other obstacles standing between you and your family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ Collect Helpful Power-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find useful items and power-ups that help you reach new places, solve challenges, and rescue chicks that seem impossible to reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Relaxing Yet Rewarding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer playing with a controller, mouse or keyboard, <strong>Chicks In Trouble</strong> offers a cozy adventure full of exploration, light action, and satisfying discoveries without overwhelming difficulty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐥 Rescue dozens of adorable lost chicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 Explore colorful farm environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Solve environmental puzzles and fun mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐓 Dodge animals, farmers, and other hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ Collect power-ups and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️ Family-friendly gameplay suitable for all ages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rescued chick brings the flock one step closer to home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/84ab860ff1b0b0064aef24d699f297c3.poster.avif?t=1788207489\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/84ab860ff1b0b0064aef24d699f297c3.webm?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/84ab860ff1b0b0064aef24d699f297c3.mp4?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f9613833baac801a260f0308882c5392.poster.avif?t=1788207489\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f9613833baac801a260f0308882c5392.webm?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/f9613833baac801a260f0308882c5392.mp4?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🐣 Rescue Every Chick. Outsmart the Farm. Save the Flock!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful day on the farm turns into a frantic rescue mission when the chicks mysteriously disappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a brave father rooster and set off on a wholesome puzzle adventure filled with clever obstacles, hidden paths, mischievous farm animals, and adorable baby chicks waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players of all ages, <strong>Chicks In Trouble</strong> combines exploration, light action and relaxing puzzle-solving into a charming family-friendly adventure that's easy to pick up but rewarding to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌾 Explore a Living Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across colorful farm environments packed with secrets, shortcuts, and surprises. Every area introduces new challenges as you search for every missing chick.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Solve Creative Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to overcome environmental puzzles, activate mechanisms, discover hidden routes, and complete a variety of fun mini-games inspired by familiar puzzle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/b7a875876bfddb33bb275a315a4b9063.poster.avif?t=1788207489\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/b7a875876bfddb33bb275a315a4b9063.webm?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/b7a875876bfddb33bb275a315a4b9063.mp4?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐕 Watch Out for Trouble!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm isn't as peaceful as it looks. Sneak past grumpy dogs, curious sheeps, suspicious farmers, and other obstacles standing between you and your family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ Collect Helpful Power-Ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find useful items and power-ups that help you reach new places, solve challenges, and rescue chicks that seem impossible to reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Relaxing Yet Rewarding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer playing with a controller, mouse or keyboard, <strong>Chicks In Trouble</strong> offers a cozy adventure full of exploration, light action, and satisfying discoveries without overwhelming difficulty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐥 Rescue dozens of adorable lost chicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 Explore colorful farm environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Solve environmental puzzles and fun mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐓 Dodge animals, farmers, and other hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ Collect power-ups and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️ Family-friendly gameplay suitable for all ages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rescued chick brings the flock one step closer to home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/84ab860ff1b0b0064aef24d699f297c3.poster.avif?t=1788207489\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/84ab860ff1b0b0064aef24d699f297c3.webm?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048470/extras/84ab860ff1b0b0064aef24d699f297c3.mp4?t=1788207489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A peaceful farm is thrown into chaos when a mother hen's chicks mysteriously vanish! Team up with the brave father rooster and embark on a quirky, obstacle-filled adventure to bring them home. Grab your mouse or gamepad—it's time to save the flock!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/